  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.1: default TcpOutDir now matches Grpc.Tools (obj/ via Protobuf_OutputPath or IntermediateOutputPath) instead of project-root Generated/; set TcpOutDir explicitly for a custom folder. 1.2.0: breaking TCP codegen shape changes - remove wrapper service class, rename generated base class to <ServiceNameWithoutService>HandlerBase, derive MsgId from request/response message names with CS_/SC_ normalization and configurable msgid_prefix (TcpMsgIdPrefix). See CHANGELOG.md.",
